      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Citizens of 2035, stop believing the lie that we must continue to bail out foreign corporations and let our own workers wither away. Our current dependency on international trade is a slow, guaranteed stranglehold that is literally collapsing our domestic economy right before our eyes. I am not asking for concessions or half-measures; I am demanding a total revolution where we immediately sever all foreign trade ties and invoke total borders to force the clock on a complete shift back to American manufacturing. This is not about stopping progress, but about the most logical, necessary evolution to ensure no other nation ever again swallows us whole.",
