      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, it definitely captures her intensity. can you expand it a bit? i want her to address the critics—the people who say this isolationism is just gonna cause massive inflation and destroy the global economy. she needs to explain why those arguments are basically just fear-mongering or short-sighted, and why her plan is the only realistic way to actually protect the working class in the long run.",
