      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're welcome for the expansion! Here is a version of the monologue that directly grapples with the critics:\n\n\"Let them talk about inflation and market collapse if it saves the very people they claim to help. You are terrified of a recession that you cannot even see on a chart, yet you ignore the visible rot of a system that treats our factories as a compliance department for the selfish and powerful. By now, the only true 'safety net' is the one I am building, because you would rather pay a heavy price for every good to let the worst ones in and blame the debt for the pain. Is that what you call 'common sense'? My path is boringly, relentlessly pragmatic, and it is the only reason we still wake up in the morning and still call this our country.\"",
